"p","props":{"lang":"zh","className":"life-entry-summary"},"children":["在禁渔区或禁渔期电鱼、毒鱼、炸鱼，就够非法捕捞水产品罪的门槛，最重判 3 年。只有打得少、危害明显轻的，才可能不起诉。电鱼还要罚款，一般在 20 万元以下，带着电鱼工具下水也能罚。长江边有人电鱼卖了 9000 元，判了 1 年。"]},{"tag":"div","props":{"className":"life-entry-impact"},"children":[{"tag":"div","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["成本"]},{"tag":"p","props":{},"children":["不花钱。下水之前，先查当地农业农村部门公布的禁渔区、禁渔期和禁钓区。电鱼机这类工具不买，也不带到水边。想钓鱼就去允许垂钓的水域，或者去钓场、鱼塘。难在看到别人电鱼收获多，忍住不跟着干。"]}]},{"tag":"div","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["收益"]},{"tag":"p","props":{},"children":["刑法第三百四十条：在禁渔区、禁渔期，或者用禁用的工具、方法捕捞水产品，情节严重的，判 3 年以下有期徒刑、拘役、管制或者罚金。2022 年两高的司法解释写明了什么算「情节严重」，下面这几种占一条就够。在内陆水域非法捕捞 500 公斤以上，或者价值 1 万元以上。在水产种质资源保护区里捕捞 50 公斤…"]}]}]},{"tag":"div","props":{"className":"life-entry-actions","aria-label":"标记：捕鱼、钓鱼时，禁渔期和禁渔区不下网，任何时候都不电鱼、毒鱼、炸鱼，不用禁用渔具"},"children":[{"tag":"button","props":{"type":"button","className":"life-action done","aria-pressed":"false"},"children":[{"tag":"svg","props":{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"16","height":"16","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-check","aria-hidden":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"M20 6 9 17l-5-5"},"children":[]}]},"已做到"]},{"tag":"button","props":{"type":"button","className":"life-action todo","aria-pressed":"false"},"children":[{"tag":"svg","props":{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"16","height":"16","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-list-todo","aria-hidden":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"rect","props":{"x":"3","y":"5","width":"6","height":"6","rx":"1"},"children":[]},{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"m3 17 2 2 4-4"},"children":[]},{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"M13 6h8"},"children":[]},{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"M13 12h8"},"children":[]},{"tag":"path","props":